<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Manhattan Bagel upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Manhattan Bagel upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Wednesday it upgraded its rating on Manhattan Bagel Co to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>--It said it views the company's hiring of Richard Falcone as chief financial officer as a positive development. Falcone once served as chief financial officer of Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc.</p>
<p>--&quot;We continue to expect Q4 EPS of $0.02 versus $0.11 last year given continued West Coast difficulties,&quot; Rodman &amp; Renshaw said in a report.</p>
<p>--Manhattan Bagel was trading at 9-3/8, down 1/4.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
